  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "Given equation: 540 + 225 ÷ 15 × 25 – 260 = 415.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\n**Option 1) 15 and 25**\n\nGiven: 540 + 225 ÷ 15 × 25 – 260 = 415\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 540 + __**225 ÷ 25**__ × 15 – 260 = 415\n\n⇒ 540 + __**9 × 15**__ – 260 = 415\n\n⇒ __**540 + 135**__ – 260 = 415\n\n⇒ __675** – 260**__ = 415\n\n⇒ 415 = 415\n\n⇒ LHS = RHS\n\nOption 2) 225 and 260\n\nGiven: 540 + 225 ÷ 15 × 25 – 260 = 415\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 540 + __**260 ÷ 15**__ × 25 – 225 = 415\n\n⇒ 540 + __**17.33 × 25**__ – 225 = 415\n\n⇒ __**540 + 433.25**__ – 225 = 415\n\n⇒ __973.25 -____ 225__ = 415\n\n⇒ 748.25 ≠ 415\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) 15 and 260\n\nGiven: 540 + 225 ÷ 15 × 25 – 260 = 415\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 540 + __**225 ÷ 260**__ × 25 – 15 = 415\n\n⇒ 540 + __**0.86 × 25**__ – 15 = 415\n\n⇒ __**540 + 21.5**__ – 15 = 415\n\n⇒ __561.5__ – 15 = 415\n\n⇒ 546.5 ≠ 415\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) 225 and 25\n\nGiven: 540 + 225 ÷ 15 × 25 – 260 = 415\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 540 + __**25 ÷ 15 × 225**__ – 260 = 415\n\n⇒ __**540 + 375**__ – 260 = 415\n\n⇒ __**915**____** – 260**__ = 415\n\n⇒ 655 ≠ 415\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 1\".",
